---
const services = [
	{
		name: 'TaskPlanner',
		description: 'Flutter + ASP.NET Core',
		status: 'ONLINE',
	},
	{
		name: 'Biblioteka',
		description: 'Blazor + .NET',
		status: 'ONLINE',
	},
];
---

<section class="about" id="o-mnie">
	<div class="about-grid">

		<div class="about-content">

			<p class="section-label">
				<span></span>
				O MNIE
			</p>

			<h1>
				Łączę IT, bezpieczeństwo
				<br />
				i programowanie.
			</h1>

			<p class="lead">
				Na co dzień pracuję w pierwszej linii wsparcia IT.
				Zajmuję się obsługą zgłoszeń użytkowników,
				środowiskami Windows i Linux, monitoringiem Zabbix
				oraz analizą zdarzeń bezpieczeństwa.
			</p>

			<p>
				Po godzinach rozwijam własne aplikacje,
				uczę programowania oraz buduję własne środowisko
				laboratoryjne wykorzystujące Docker, Linux,
				.NET i rozwiązania chmurowe.
			</p>

			<div class="roles">
				<span>IT Support</span>
				<span>Zabbix</span>
				<span>SecureVisio / SIEM</span>
				<span>Trener programowania</span>
				<span>.NET</span>
				<span>Linux</span>
			</div>

			<div class="actions">
				<a
					class="github"
					href="https://github.com/JacekJochemczyk"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
				>
					GitHub ↗
				</a>

				<a href="#projekty">
					Moje projekty ↓
				</a>
			</div>

		</div>


		<aside class="status-panel">

			<div class="status-header">
				<div>
					<p>SYSTEM STATUS</p>
					<h2>Moje aplikacje</h2>
				</div>

				<span class="live">
					<i></i>
					LIVE
				</span>
			</div>

			<div class="services">

				{services.map((service) => (
					<div class="service">

						<div class="service-info">
							<span class="dot"></span>

							<div>
								<strong>{service.name}</strong>
								<p>{service.description}</p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<span class="online">
							{service.status}
						</span>

					</div>
				))}

			</div>

			<div class="status-footer">
				<span>Oracle Cloud Infrastructure</span>
				<span>•</span>
				<span>HTTPS</span>
			</div>

		</aside>

	</div>
</section>


<style>
	.about {
		min-height: calc(100vh - 75px);

		display: flex;
		align-items: center;

		padding: 100px 7%;

		position: relative;

		background:
			radial-gradient(
				circle at 80% 20%,
				rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.09),
				transparent 32%
			),
			#07090d;
	}

	.about-grid {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 1280px;

		margin: 0 auto;

		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;

		gap: 100px;

		align-items: center;
	}

	.section-label {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;

		gap: 10px;

		margin: 0 0 25px;

		font-size: 0.74rem;
		font-weight: 700;

		letter-spacing: 0.16em;

		color: #94a3b8;
	}

	.section-label span {
		width: 8px;
		height: 8px;

		border-radius: 50%;

		background: #3b82f6;

		box-shadow:
			0 0 10px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.8);
	}

	h1 {
		max-width: 750px;

		margin: 0 0 30px;

		font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4.8rem);

		line-height: 1.03;

		letter-spacing: -0.045em;

		color: #f8fafc;
	}

	.about-content > p:not(.section-label) {
		max-width: 720px;

		color: #94a3b8;

		line-height: 1.8;

		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	.about-content .lead {
		font-size: 1.1rem;

		color: #cbd5e1;
	}

	.roles {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;

		gap: 9px;

		margin-top: 30px;
	}

	.roles span {
		padding: 7px 11px;

		border: 1px solid #1f2937;

		border-radius: 6px;

		background: #0b1018;

		color: #64748b;

		font-size: 0.78rem;
	}

	.actions {
		display: flex;

		gap: 16px;

		margin-top: 34px;
	}

	.actions a {
		color: #94a3b8;

		text-decoration: none;

		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.actions a:hover {
		color: white;
	}

	.actions .github {
		color: #60a5fa;
	}


	/* STATUS */

	.status-panel {
		border: 1px solid #1f2937;

		border-radius: 14px;

		background: rgba(9, 13, 20, 0.9);

		box-shadow:
			0 25px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);

		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.status-header {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;

		padding: 24px;

		border-bottom: 1px solid #1f2937;
	}

	.status-header p {
		margin: 0 0 5px;

		color: #475569;

		font-size: 0.65rem;

		letter-spacing: 0.16em;
	}

	.status-header h2 {
		margin: 0;

		color: #f8fafc;

		font-size: 1.2rem;
	}

	.live {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;

		gap: 7px;

		color: #22c55e;

		font-size: 0.68rem;
		font-weight: 700;

		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
	}

	.live i {
		width: 7px;
		height: 7px;

		border-radius: 50%;

		background: #22c55e;

		box-shadow:
			0 0 9px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.8);
	}

	.services {
		padding: 8px 24px;
	}

	.service {
		min-height: 82px;

		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;

		border-bottom: 1px solid #161e2b;
	}

	.service:last-child {
		border-bottom: none;
	}

	.service-info {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;

		gap: 13px;
	}

	.service-info .dot {
		width: 8px;
		height: 8px;

		border-radius: 50%;

		background: #22c55e;

		box-shadow:
			0 0 8px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.7);
	}

	.service strong {
		color: #e2e8f0;

		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.service p {
		margin: 5px 0 0;

		color: #475569;

		font-size: 0.75rem;
	}

	.online {
		color: #22c55e;

		font-size: 0.67rem;

		font-weight: 700;

		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
	}

	.status-footer {
		display: flex;

		gap: 8px;

		padding: 15px 24px;

		border-top: 1px solid #1f2937;

		color: #475569;

		font-size: 0.7rem;
	}


	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.about-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;

			gap: 60px;
		}

		.about {
			padding:
				80px 24px;
		}
	}
</style>